{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247", "id": 2184738136, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s6COHVY", "number": 2247, "title": "`set_rate` for AngularVelocityBody", "user": {"login": "RizzwareEngineer", "id": 67522964, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY3NTIyOTY0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67522964?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/RizzwareEngineer", "html_url": "https://github.com/RizzwareEngineer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RizzwareEngineer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RizzwareEngineer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RizzwareEngineer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RizzwareEngineer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RizzwareEngineer/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RizzwareEngineer/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RizzwareEngineer/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RizzwareEngineer/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/RizzwareEngineer/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2024-03-13T19:25:41Z", "updated_at": "2024-05-27T09:39:29Z", "closed_at": "2024-05-27T09:39:29Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "Searching through [documentation](https://mavsdk.mavlink.io/main/en/cpp/api_reference/classmavsdk_1_1_telemetry.html), there are a number of Telemetry methods that do not list their respective synchronous version.\r\n\r\nFor example, I'd like to receive AngularVelocityBody telemetry at the same rate as position as exemplified below:\r\n```cpp\r\n    const auto set_rate_position = telemetry.set_rate_position(1.0);\r\n    if (set_rate_position != Telemetry::Result::Success) {\r\n        std::cerr << \"Setting rate for position failed: \" << set_rate_position << '\\n';\r\n        return 1;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // Set up callback to monitor altitude while the vehicle is in flight\r\n    telemetry.subscribe_position([](Telemetry::Position position) {\r\n        std::cout << \"Altitude: \" << position.relative_altitude_m << \" m\\n\";\r\n    });\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, the documentation makes no mention of AngularVelocityBody's, let alone a handful of method's, `set_rate` equivalent. \r\n\r\nI must be looking in the wrong direction, or did I misinterpret this documentation snippet?\r\n`\r\nAll the methods have both synchronous and asynchronous versions, and users can set the rate at which the vehicle provides updates for each type of information. All the methods of a particular type (synchronous, asynchronous, and set_rate methods) are used in the same way.\r\n`", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2002720503", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247#issuecomment-2002720503", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247", "id": 2002720503, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s53Xxb3", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-03-18T01:31:13Z", "updated_at": "2024-03-18T01:31:13Z", "body": "The docs are usually lying. The source is the truth. :smile:\r\n\r\nIt's a bit tricky, because some of the topics rely on the same message. In this case `AngularVelocityBody` actually comes with the [ATTITUDE](https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ATTITUDE) message, so you can set the rate by using `set_rate_attitude`.\r\n\r\nSee here:\r\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/e06de06d9770b94d6d1ae0a2937ee5f2f2a0ebfb/src/mavsdk/plugins/telemetry/telemetry_impl.cpp#L780-L804\r\n\r\nI'm aware this is not optimal but I don't have a good solution. I guess the best would be to add some docstrings describing this?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2002720503/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}], "timeline": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2002720503", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247#issuecomment-2002720503", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2247", "id": 2002720503, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s53Xxb3", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-03-18T01:31:13Z", "updated_at": "2024-03-18T01:31:13Z", "body": "The docs are usually lying. The source is the truth. :smile:\r\n\r\nIt's a bit tricky, because some of the topics rely on the same message. In this case `AngularVelocityBody` actually comes with the [ATTITUDE](https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ATTITUDE) message, so you can set the rate by using `set_rate_attitude`.\r\n\r\nSee here:\r\nhttps://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/e06de06d9770b94d6d1ae0a2937ee5f2f2a0ebfb/src/mavsdk/plugins/telemetry/telemetry_impl.cpp#L780-L804\r\n\r\nI'm aware this is not optimal but I don't have a good solution. I guess the best would be to add some docstrings describing this?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2002720503/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"id": 12943424863, "node_id": "CE_lADOBabE0s6COHVYzwAAAAMDfP1f", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/events/12943424863", "actor": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "event": "closed", "commit_id": null, "commit_url": null, "created_at": "2024-05-27T09:39:29Z", "state_reason": null, "intent": null, "performed_via_github_app": null}], "fetched_at": "2026-08-28T20:39:18Z"}